* layers.library in the C900 dialect of an Amiga fd file, from AROS's
* layers.conf.  Each function takes LayersBase first; the C functions are
* AROS_LH definitions named Layers_N after their vector.  A function that
* keeps its register list is not implemented.
##base _LayersBase
##bias 30
##public
